# Local emulator config for the `demo-goldstar` project id, the id scripts/emulator-config.mjs uses
# at the default offset. firebase-tools loads `.env.<projectId>` only for the matching project, and
# `demo-*` ids are emulator-only (no real project, no deploy target), so nothing here reaches a
# deployed function.
#
# Turns on the emulator-only demo providers: plate OCR, SMS, email, hotel PMS, Toast POS and Secret
# Manager use in-process fakes instead of vendor APIs, so those flows complete in a local demo. The
# code also requires FUNCTIONS_EMULATOR=true, which only the emulator sets.
# See functions/src/lib/demoProviders.ts.
GOLDSTAR_DEMO_PROVIDERS=1
